        'rawContent': "{{Starship Class Information|\n|name = UEAS Radiance\n|image = \n|caption = UEAS Radiance\n|designation = Warship Class\n|builder = \n|operator = \n|number_of_ships = \n|crew = \n|length = \n|beam = \n|height = \n|powerplant = \n|propulsion = \n|weapons = \n|armor = \n|shields = \n}}\n\n---\r\ntitle: \"UEAS_Radiance\"\r 2501\rlatest_revision_id: 6587\r\nlast_updated: \"2007-10-07 03:00:17\"\r  - \"Destroyers\"\r\ntemplates: []\r---The UEAS ''Radiance'' was an [[ADF-4000 Class Destroyer]] assigned to the [[Alpha Centauri System]]. It was part of the [[United Earth Alliance Defense Force]], but was infiltrated and taken over by the [[Omegas]].\r\n\r\nFrom [[2300]] until [[2315]], the ''Radiance'' was used to dupe the [[United Earth Alliance]] into believing all was well on [[Ah Kin]]. The regular annual inspectors were given tours of the ''Radiance'', and kept away from sensitive areas being devoted to the buildup of the [[Onyx Empire]].\r\n\r\n[[Category:Destroyers]]"
