        'rawContent': "{{Starship Class Information|\n|name = Vita'safina aina Kifa\n|image = Vita'safinaainaKifa1.jpg\n|caption = Vita'safina aina Kifa\n|designation = Warship Class\n|builder = \n|operator = \n|number_of_ships = \n|crew = 100\n|length = \n|beam = \n|height = \n|powerplant = \n|propulsion = \n|weapons = 8 Bunduki'kubwa Hyperspace Distortion Cannons <br/> 24 Gobori'dogo Anti-Fighter Relativistic Mass Drivers\n|armor = \n|shields = \n}}\n\n---\r\ntitle: \"Vita'safina_aina_Kifa\"\r 2919\rlatest_revision_id: 7125\r\nlast_updated: \"2007-10-11 14:18:27\"\r---\r\ntemplates: []\r---*Dimensions:\r\n**Length: 230 meters\r\n**Width: 230 meters\r\n**Height: 110 meters\r\n*Acceleration: 1.8 KPH/S\r\n*Crew: 100\r\n*Troops: 60 Ardhi'nyuka\r\n*Armament:\r\n**8 Bunduki'kubwa Hyperspace Distortion Cannons\r\n**24 Gobori'dogo Anti-Fighter Relativistic Mass Drivers\r\n*Defensive Systems:\r\n**Kigao Proton-Bond Armor\r\n**Kingilizi Energy/Matter Barrier\r\n*Sublight Drive: Shirang'oa Gravity Drive\r\n*Long-Range FTL Drive: Shiram'bio Displacement Drive\r\n\r\n===Overview===\r\n\r\nVita'safina aina Kifa are the most common Ngrligru light warship.\r\n\r\n[[Image:Vita'safinaainaKifa1.jpg]]\r\n\r\nTheir unique saucer shape is synonymous with Ngrligru invasions--so much so that \"flying saucers\" were remembered by all humanoid races in their ancient history.\r\n\r\n===Capabilities===\r\n\r\nKifa carry simple weapons, by [[Ngrligru]] standards.  Their main weapons are Bunduki'kubwa Hyperspace Distortion Cannons, similar to Meroniri Riptide Cannons.  According to most [[Mtomigru]] historians, the weapons were actually stolen during the Sundering, but never upgraded.  The Meroniri have made great strides, and their Riptide Cannons are superior.\r\n\r\n[[Image:Vita'safinaainaKifa2.jpg]]\r\n\r\nFor anti-fighter defenses, Kifa carry Gobori'dogo Relativistic Mass Drivers.  These cannons are as powerful as most humanoid cruiser main weapons.\r\n\r\n===Deployment===\r\n\r\nKifa are usually assigned to a Nina'rikebu to defend it and act as landing craft.\r\n\r\n[[Image:Vita'safinaainaKifa3.jpg]]\r\n\r\nThey can operate in deep space by themselves, but don't carry enough supplies for extended operations.\r\n\r\n[[Category:Frigates]]"
