        'rawContent': "{{Starship Class Information|\r\n|name =Riiktar Class Destroyer\r\n|image = [[Image:Riiktar Class Destroyer Standard View.jpg|200px]]\r\n|caption =A profile of the Riiktar Class Destroyer\r\n|designation =Medium [[:Category:Destroyers|Destroyer]]\r\n|builder =[[Rikaz Lorithos Kihtor Terok]]\r\n|operator =[[Ailen Suvak Tashir Fahr]]<br/>\r\n|number_of_ships = ??\r\n|list_of_ships = Notable:<br/>??\r\n|crew =1,070 Ship Crew\r\n110 Flight Crew\r\n|length =397.2\r\n|beam =167.1\r\n|height =98.7\r\n|total_volume =1,961,635.1\r\n|powerplant =2 x ??\r\n|propulsion =4 x ??\r\n|ftl_drive =1 x Baihros Estin Fohrvik (???)\r\n|acceleration =??\r\n|sensors =\r\n|processing_system =??\r\n|aircraft =3 Fighter Squadrons<br/>1 Bomber Squadron<br/>1 Gatrir Docking Port\r\n|personnel =360 Rhuev Robotic Infantry<br/>60 Krelbine Robotic Infantry\r\n|support_capacity =294,245.3\r\n|weapons =8 x [[Bukrah Energy Weapon|Heavy Bukrah Cannons]]<br/>26 x [[Bukrah Energy Weapon|Capital Bukrah Cannons]]<br/>16 x [[Lorithos Conventional Missile Warheads#Skrike Missiles|Skrike Missile Tubes]]<br/>2 x [[Lorithos Conventional Missile Warheads#Skrike Missiles|Sur-Skrike Torpedo Tubes]]<br/>6 x [[Bukrah Energy Weapon|Bukrah AA Turrets]]<br/>\r\n|armor =[[Lorithos Tzaiko Composite Armor]]\r\n|shields =??\r\n|special =??\r\n}}\r\n\r\nThe [[Riiktar Class Destroyer]] is a Lorithos ship.  Someone should sure write about it!\r\n\r\n=== History ===\r\n\r\nIt's got some.  See the old writeup.\r\n\r\n==== Development ====\r\n\r\nIt'd be cool if Justin could make some cool renders, too!\r\n\r\n[[Image:Riiktar Class Destroyer Side View.jpg|left|400px]]\r\n\r\n[[Image:Riiktar Class Destroyer Top View.jpg|left|400px]]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n=== See Also ===\r\n\r\nComparable Ships:\r\n* None yet.\r\n\r\nAdditional Information:\r\n* [[Riiktar Class Destroyer.ldr|Blueprints download]]\r\n\r\n==== Complete List of Ships ====\r\n\r\nShips in the ''Riiktar'' Class\r\n* None yet.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\n*Dimensions:\r\n**Length: 397.2 meters\r\n**Width: 167.1 meters\r\n**Height: 98.7 meters\r\n**Volume: 1,961,635.1 m3\r\n*Acceleration: 1.0 KPH/S\r\n*Crew: 1,070\r\n*Support Crew: 110\r\n*Troops:\r\n**360 Ruehv Robotic Troopers\r\n**60 Krelbine Robotic Troopers\r\n*Dropships: Docking Port for one Gatrir\r\n*Aerospace Complement:\r\n**3 Fighter Squadrons\r\n**1 Bomber Squadron\r\n**4 Shuttles or Transports\r\n*Support Capacity: 294,245 m3\r\n*Armament:\r\n**8 Heavy Blaster cannons\r\n**26 Standard Blaster cannons\r\n**16 Conventional Skrike Missile Launchers\r\n**2 Sur-Skrike Torpedo Tubes\r\n*Defensive Systems:\r\n**Warship-Grade Garvask Shield Generator\r\n**Tzaiko Composite armor\r\n*Sublight Drive: Lorithos Hydrogen Drive\r\n*FTL Drive: Bailey Hyperspace Tunnel Generator\r\n\r\n===Overview===\r\n\r\nThe armies of all the heirs involved in the Burning War were feared, but none so greatly as Goff Riiktar.  He poisoned the ocean, and caused so much environmental damage that the other three heirs temporarily banded together to kill him.\r\n\r\n[[Image:RiiktarClassMediumDestroyer1.jpg]]\r\n\r\nMemories are so strong that the name Riiktar is used to frighten small children into obedience.  \"As evil as Riiktar\" was a common description of Lucius Black during the Second Exodus War.  The name was an ideal choice for the powerful medium destroyer of the Lorithos ASTF.\r\n\r\n===Capabilities===\r\n\r\nThe main weapons of Riiktar Destroyers are an array of eight Heavy Blaster cannons, backed up by twenty-six Standard Blaster cannon turrets.  Warship-grade Blaster cannons are much stronger than most cannons.  They fire faster and track better than any other humanoid warship weapon.\r\n\r\nRiiktar Destroyers carry sixteen Skrike missile launchers and two Sur-Skrike torpedo tubes, which can deliver large payloads of conventional weapons, but not nuclear.\r\n\r\n[[Image:RiiktarClassMediumDestroyer2.jpg]]\r\n\r\nWhile the Riiktar is quite capable of defending itself, its necessary to carry fighters to help it in campaigns against ground targets.  The medium destroyer can carry three fighter squadrons and one bomber squadron.\r\n\r\nTough as it is, the Riiktar is faster than most humanoid light frigates.  It turns a little slowly, but its tough armor and shields make it as hard to take down as a medium cruiser.\r\n\r\n===Deployment===\r\n\r\nRiiktars were involved in the Lorithos/Blackis battle in the Titanian system.  The Lorithos ASTF took no Riiktar losses--the warship was much stronger than the Imperial Vigilant Frigates.\r\n\r\n[[Image:RiiktarClassMediumDestroyer3.jpg]]\r\n\r\nThe Lorithos ASTF keeps a lot of Riiktars in its two fleets.  They're tough, powerful and resilient.  Maintenance is low, so the warships can take long tours of duty.  The Lorithos ASTF currently fields sixteen Riiktar medium destroyers.\r\n\r\n[[Category:Destroyers]]"
