        'rawContent': "{{Starship Class Information|\r\n|name =Svenj Class Destroyer\r\n|image = [[Image:Svenj Class Destroyer Standard View.jpg|200px]]\r\n|caption =A profile of the Svenj Class Destroyer\r\n|designation =Light [[:Category:Destroyers|Destroyer]]\r\n|builder =[[Rikaz Lorithos Kihtor Terok]]\r\n|operator =[[Ailen Suvak Tashir Fahr]]<br/>\r\n|number_of_ships = ??\r\n|list_of_ships = Notable:<br/>??\r\n|crew =700 Ship Crew\r\n70 Flight Crew\r\n|length =346.3\r\n|beam =146.6\r\n|height =81.5\r\n|total_volume =1,280,055.2\r\n|powerplant =4 x ??\r\n|propulsion =4 x ??\r\n|ftl_drive =1 x Baihros Estin Fohrvik (???)\r\n|acceleration =??\r\n|sensors =\r\n|processing_system =??\r\n|aircraft =4 Fighter Squadrons<br/>2 Bomber Squadron<br/>1 Gatrir Docking Port\r\n|personnel =228 Rhuev Robotic Infantry<br/>36 Krelbine Robotic Infantry\r\n|support_capacity =192,008.3\r\n|weapons =4 x [[Bukrah Energy Weapon|Heavy Bukrah Cannons]]<br/>16 x [[Bukrah Energy Weapon|Capital Bukrah Cannons]]<br/>6 x [[Lorithos Conventional Missile Warheads#Skrike Missiles|Skrike Missile Tubes]]<br/>2 x [[Lorithos Conventional Missile Warheads#Skrike Missiles|Sur-Skrike Torpedo Tubes]]<br/>4 x [[Bukrah Energy Weapon|Bukrah AA Turrets]]<br/>\r\n|armor =[[Lorithos Tzaiko Composite Armor]]\r\n|shields =??\r\n|special =??\r\n}}\r\n\r\nThe '''Svenj Class Destroyer''' is a Lorithos ship.  Someone should sure write about it!\r\n\r\n=== History ===\r\n\r\nIt's got some.  See the old writeup.\r\n\r\n==== Development ====\r\n\r\nIt'd be cool if Justin could make some cool renders, too!\r\n\r\n[[Image:Svenj Class Destroyer Side View.jpg|left|400px]]\r\n\r\n[[Image:Svenj Class Destroyer Top View.jpg|left|400px]]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n=== See Also ===\r\n\r\nComparable Ships:\r\n* None yet.\r\n\r\nAdditional Information:\r\n* [[Svenj Class Destroyer.ldr|Blueprints download]]\r\n\r\n==== Complete List of Ships ====\r\n\r\nShips in the ''Svenj'' Class\r\n* None yet.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\n\r\n*Dimensions:\r\n**Length: 346.3 meters\r\n**Width: 146.6 meters\r\n**Height: 81.5 meters\r\n**Volume: 1,280,055.2 m3\r\n*Acceleration: 1.2 KPH/S\r\n*Crew: 700\r\n*Support Crew: 70\r\n*Troops:\r\n**228 Ruehv Robotic Troopers\r\n**36 Krelbine Robotic Troopers\r\n*Dropships: Docking Port for one Gatrir\r\n*Aerospace Complement:\r\n**4 Fighter Squadrons\r\n**1 Shuttle or Transport\r\n*Support Capacity: 192,010 m3\r\n*Armament:\r\n**4 Heavy Blaster cannons\r\n**16 Standard Blaster cannons\r\n**6 Conventional Skrike Missile Launchers\r\n**2 Sur-Skrike Torpedo Tubes\r\n*Defensive Systems:\r\n**Warship-Grade Garvask Shield Generator\r\n**Tzaiko Composite armor\r\n*Sublight Drive: Lorithos Hydrogen Drive\r\n*FTL Drive: Bailey Hyperspace Tunnel Generator\r\n\r\n===Overview===\r\n\r\nSvenj Class Light Destroyers were built near the end of the [[Burning Wars]] by the forces of the would-be Emperor [[Torm Krelbine]].\r\n\r\n[[Image:SvenjClassLightDestroyer1.jpg]]\r\n\r\nThe warlord nearly won the war with his fleet, but died in the last battle with [[Kian Huern]].\r\n\r\n===Capabilities===\r\n\r\nThe main weapons of Svenj Light Destroyers are an array of four Heavy Blaster cannons, and sixteen Standard Blaster cannon turrets.  Warship-grade Blaster cannons are much stronger than most cannons. They fire faster and track better than any other humanoid warship weapon.\r\n\r\nSvenj Destroyers carry six Skrike missile launchers and two Sur-Skrike torpedo tubes.  These can deliver large payloads of conventional weapons, but not nuclear.  In the Burning War, the Svenj Destroyers in Torm Krelbine's navy carried massive nuclear payloads.\r\n\r\n[[Image:SvenjClassLightDestroyer2.jpg]]\r\n\r\nThe Svenj is small, but still carries a fighter complement.  It can carry four squadrons of fighters, usually Vadries and Milroks, but carries no bomber squadrons.\r\n\r\nWith its Garvask Shields and Tzaiko Composite armor, the Svenj is well-defended against its enemies.  It's armor is and was tougher than that of the Blijrok, but it is slightly slower and less maneuverable.\r\n\r\n===Deployment===\r\n\r\nWhen the [[Meroniri Terinasi]] began helping the Lorithos people rebuild Lorithan, they also built up their defenses with technology the Lorithos could easily rebuild.  The Rikaz Lorithos built two fleets of warships--ninety-four total warships.\r\n\r\n[[Image:SvenjClassLightDestroyer3.jpg]]\r\n\r\nThe ASTF mainstay warship is the Svenj.  With its tough combat abilities, high speed, and fighter capacity, it's an ideal choice for most situations.  The Lorithos ASTF currently fields thirty Svenj Light Destroyers.\r\n\r\n[[Category:Destroyers]]"
