        'rawContent': "{{Starship Class Information|\r\n|name =Starmaster class Destroyer\r\n|image =[[Image:Starmaster.png|180px]]\r\n|caption =Starmaster Destroyer\r\n|designation =[[:Category:Destroyers|Destroyer]]\r\n|builder =[[Fireline Industries]]\r\n|operator =[[United Mesarthrim Clans]]<br/>[[United Centusi States]]<br/>[[Auellal League]]\r\n|number_of_ships = 340\r\n|list_of_ships = [[UMCS Sternmaster|UMCS ''Sternmaster'' (Zs-1)]]<br/>[[UCSN Dodd|UCSN ''Dodd'' (Zs-84)]]<br/>[[UCSN Mann|UCSN ''Mann'' (Zs-85)]]<br/>[[UCSN Tischler|UCSN ''Tischler'' (Zs-87)]]<br/>[[UCSN Wolfgang|UCSN ''Wolfgang'' (Zs-89)]]<br/>[[Armada Mongrel King's Sword|''Cliwe-ree'' (<small>''formerly''</small> Zs-229)]]<br/>[[Starmaster class Destroyer#Complete List of Ships|View Complete List]]\r\n|crew =250\r\n|length =0\r\n|beam =0\r\n|height =0\r\n|powerplant =[[Strauss Energie]] [[Querbalken Generator]]\r\n|propulsion =[[Zukünftige Designs]] [[Gravity Variance Drive]]\r\n|ftl_drive =[[Die fünften Allee-Motoren]] [[Gammastrahl-Licht-Antrieb|GLA]]\r\n|acceleration =\r\n|sensors =[[Mesar Schnittstelle Gruppe]] [[Dialogkommunikation]]\r\n|processing_system =[[Mesar Schnittstelle Gruppe]] [[Nachtpferd]]\r\n|aircraft =1 x [[:Category:Fighters|Fighter]] Squadron<br/>1 x Troop Squadron\r\n|personnel =125 [[Myt'herra]]/[[Fir Turtyle]]\r\n|weapons =8 x Type-G Heavy [[Blazer|Blazers]]<br/>7 x Type-Three Repeating [[Blazer|Blazers]]<br/>9 Variable Payload Missile Launcher\r\n|armor =[[Mysterium-Stahl]] [[Leifstein Composite Armor]]\r\n|shields =[[Zweiundzwanzig]] [[Automated Adaptive Shielding]]\r\n|special =\r\n}}\r\nThe Starmaster class Destroyer was designed by [[Fireline Industries]] as the lead design in their [[Fireline Industries#Star Series|Star Series]] designs.  The design was built around the concept of mounting heavy weapons on a fast, agile, airframe.  The Starmasters were designed to be the core unit in the [[United Mesarthrim Clans Kriegsmarine|Kriegsmarine]].  [[Fireline Industries]] established a orbital construction facility witin the safe zone in the [[Cirus System]] and were able to construct Starmaster's unabated.  The first Starmaster, Zs-1, was delivered to the [[United Mesarthrim Clans Kriegsmarine|Kriegsmarine]] on August 22nd, [[2275]].\r\n\r\n==History==\r\nThe ''Star Class'' was [[Fireline Industries]] desperate gamble to save itself from bankruptcy.  In [[2262]], two years after incorporating, [[Fireline Industries]] hadn't sold a major design to the [[United Mesarthim Clans]], all their fighter and tank designs were lackluster compared to [[Mesarbauer]] and [[Mesar Luftfahrt]].  So, rather then mimicking designs, the ''Star Class'' was created as a completely new design.\r\n\r\n{|\r\n|- valign=\"top\"\r\n|[[Image:Starmaster.png|200px]]\r\n|[[Image:2326 Starmaster.png|200px]]\r\n|[[Image:Eye of the Tempest.png|200px]]\r\n|- align=\"center\"\r\n|[[United Mesarthrim Clans Kriegsmarine|UMC Kriegsmarine]]<br/>[[2260]] to [[2326]]<br/>''[[Fireline Industries]]''\r\n|[[United Centusi States Kriegsmarine|UCS Kriegsmarine]]<br/>[[2326]] to [[2335]]<br/>''[[Mesarbauer|Mesarbauer Kodi]]''\r\n|[[Auellal Armada]]<br/>[[2324]] to [[2335]]<br/>''[[Fireline Industries|Fireline Mongrel]]''\r\n||\r\n|}\r\n\r\n[[Category:Fireline Industries]]\r\n[[Category:Destroyers]]\r\n[[Category:United Mesarthrim Clans Kriegsmarine]]\r\n[[Category:United Centusi States Kriegsmarine]]\r\n[[Category:Auellal Armada]]"
