        'rawContent': "{{Starship Class Information|\r\n|name =Fohdskramer Class Carrier\r\n|image = [[Image:Fohdskramer Class Carrier Standard View.jpg|200px]]\r\n|caption =A profile of the Fohdskramer Class Carrier\r\n|designation =[[:Category:Carriers|Carrier]]\r\n|builder =[[Kungens Maron Karvet]]\r\n|operator =[[Reigess Renskader]]<br/>\r\n|number_of_ships = ??\r\n|list_of_ships = Notable:<br/>??\r\n|crew =1,940 Ship Crew\r\n|length =531.7\r\n|beam =208.5\r\n|height =174.0\r\n|total_volume =5,699,330.5\r\n|powerplant =2 x ??\r\n|propulsion =2 x ??\r\n|ftl_drive =1 x (???)\r\n|acceleration =??\r\n|sensors =\r\n|processing_system =??\r\n|aircraft =40 Fighter Squadrons<br/>\r\n12 Shuttles\r\n|personnel =2,052 [[Likniir Vaktida]]<br/>(upto 336 [[Finnis Suits]])\r\n|support_capacity =1,994,765.7\r\n|weapons =5 x [[Forros Gun|Forros Guns]]<br/>28 x [[Hälregn Pulse Cannon|Hälregn Pulse Cannons]]<br/>52 x [[Reigen Multi-Load Missile Tube|Multi-Load Missile Tubes]]<br/>14 x [[Kolmberad Energy Weapon|Kolmberad CIWS Turrets]]<br/>\r\n|armor =[[Reigen Järnhud Composite Armor]]\r\n|shields =[[Strålkransköld Composite Shielding]]\r\n|special =??\r\n}}\r\n\r\nThe [[Fohdskramer Class Carrier]] is a Reigen ship.  Someone should sure write about it!\r\n\r\n=== History ===\r\n\r\nIt's got some.  See the old writeup.\r\n\r\n==== Development ====\r\n\r\nIt'd be cool if Justin could make some cool renders, too!\r\n\r\n[[Image:Fohdskramer Class Carrier Side View.jpg|left|400px]]\r\n\r\n[[Image:Fohdskramer Class Carrier Top View.jpg|left|400px]]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n=== See Also ===\r\n\r\nComparable Ships:\r\n* None yet.\r\n\r\nAdditional Information:\r\n* [[Fohdskramer Class Carrier.ldr|Blueprints download]]\r\n\r\n==== Complete List of Ships ====\r\n\r\nShips in the ''Fohdskramer'' Class\r\n* None yet.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\n\r\n*Designation: Battle Carrier \r\n*Dimensions:\r\n**Length: 531.7 meters\r\n**Width: 208.5 meters\r\n**Height: 174.0 meters\r\n**Volume: 5,699,330.5 m3\r\n*Crew: 1,940\r\n*Support Crew: 750\r\n*Troops: \r\n**2,052 Royal Likniir\r\n**336 Finnis Armor suits\r\n*Support Capacity: 1,994,765 m3 \r\nAircraft Complement:\r\n**40 Fighter Squadrons\r\n**12 Shuttles or Transports\r\n*Armament:\r\n**5 'Forros' MGW Guns\r\n**28 'Sinne Grokt' AFP Cannons\r\n**52 Capital Multi-load Missile Tubes\r\n**14 Anti-Aircraft GRASER Emplacements\r\n*Defensive Systems:\r\n**Lirn Vasq Armor\r\n**Faoern Biisiv HiCS System\r\n**Vasakrig Capital Automated Countermeasures System\r\n*Sublight Drive: Gravity Cavitation Drive\r\n*Faster-than-Light Drive: Kiiribaugh Hyperspace Propulsion System\r\n\r\n===Overview===\r\n\r\n[[Image:LorrodivanClassBattleCarrier1.jpg]]\r\n\r\n===Capabilities===\r\n\r\n[[Image:LorrodivanClassBattleCarrier2.jpg]]\r\n\r\n===Deployment===\r\n\r\n[[Image:LorrodivanClassBattleCarrier3.jpg]]\r\n\r\n[[Category:Carriers]]"
