        'rawContent': "{{Starship Class Information|\r\n|name =Astrala Class Escort Cruiser\r\n|image = [[Image:Astrala Class Escort Cruiser Standard View.jpg|200px]]\r\n|caption =The Astrala Class Escort Cruiser Line\r\n|designation =[[:Category:Cruisers|Escort Cruiser]]\r\n|builder =\r\n|operator =[[Meroniri Yatisu]]\r\n|number_of_ships =\r\n|list_of_ships = \r\n|crew =\r\n|length =\r\n|beam =\r\n|height =\r\n|total_volume =\r\n|powerplant =\r\n|propulsion =\r\n|ftl_drive =\r\n|acceleration =\r\n|sensors =\r\n|processing_system =\r\n|aircraft =\r\n|personnel =\r\n|support_capacity =\r\n|weapons =Main Guns (no name yet)<br/>Emitters (no name yet)<br/>Missile Tubes (no name yet)\r\n|armor =\r\n|shields =\r\n|special =\r\n}}\r\n\r\nThe '''Astrala Class Escort Cruiser''' is seen everywhere in [[Meroniri]] space. It engages in frequent patrols of their worlds and interests throughout the [[Orion Arm]], and often makes visits to friendly ports of call in other human sectors.\r\n\r\nThe Astrala is built to engage smaller ships while its \"big brother\", the [[Tronit Class Warcruiser]] handles the largest targets.\r\n\r\n[[Image:Astrala Class Escort Cruiser Side View.jpg|200px]]\r\n\r\n[[Image:Astrala Class Escort Cruiser Top View.jpg|200px]]\r\n\r\n[[Image:Astrala Class Escort Cruiser Weapons Visible Standard View.jpg|200px]]\r\n\r\n[[Image:Astrala Class Escort Cruiser Weapons Visible Side View.jpg|200px]]\r\n\r\n[[Category:Cruisers]]"
