        'rawContent': "{{Starship Class Information|\r\n|name =Jerome Black Class Battleship\r\n|image = [[Image:Jerome Black Class Battleship Standard View.jpg|200px]]\r\n|caption =The Jerome Black Class Battleship Line\r\n|designation =[[:Category:Battleships|Battleship]]\r\n|builder = [[Tanaku Starship Design Bureau]]<br/>[[Haven Shipyards]]\r\n|operator =[[Royal Imperial Navy]]<br/>[[Prefecture Galactic Navy]]\r\n|number_of_ships = 1\r\n|list_of_ships = [[FDS Jerome Black|FDS ''Jerome Black'' (BG-1)]]\r\n|crew =10,830 Ship Crew + 1,280 Support Crew\r\n|length =1,099.6\r\n|beam =226.1\r\n|height =421.6\r\n|total_volume =22,739,742.5\r\n|powerplant =5 x R3JB \"Berkeley\" ???gW Fusion Reactors \r\n|propulsion =4 x GCD-10JB \"Mastery\" Gravity Cavitation Drives\r\n|ftl_drive =1 x Volstamik-Krenschov Jump Drive (Rated for [[Shest Band]])\r\n|acceleration =???\r\n|sensors =Helsin \"Sightlock\" SPAR system \r\n|processing_system =Helsin C922-b C<sup>4</sup>ISTAR <small><small><small>Computerized Command, Control, Communications, Intelligence, Surveillance, Target Acquisition and Reconnaissance</small></small></small>\r\n|aircraft =Up to 3 x [[:Category:Fighters|Fighter]] or Organic Support Wings<br/>Up to 2 x [[:Category:Bombers|Bomber/Attack]] Wings<br/>2 x Cargo Squadrons\r\n|personnel =Up to 6,100 Marines<br/>Up to 600 Heavy Armor Suits\r\n|support_capacity =3,410,961.4\r\n|weapons =8 x RMD-1 Relativistic Mass Drivers<br/>17 x MAC-5 \"Hellguns\"<br/>116 x [[Anti-Warship Torpedo|AWT-8 \"Orca\" Torpedo Launchers]]<br/>116 x [[Close-In Weapon System|CIWS-5]] Neutron Cannons\r\n|armor =Series-10 Composite Armor Plating \r\n|shields =GGS-10 Gravity Shield<br/>MDS-20 Deflector Screens \r\n|special = [[Prism]] [[Engineered Intelligence]]\r\n}}\r\n\r\nThe Jerome Black Class Subspace Cruiser was built as a proof-of-concept for Dr. [[Richard Holder]]'s [[Entropy Drive]].  It was adopted by [[Anthony Hadrian]] as his personal flagship, and is both an effective combatant and a subtle command ship.\r\n\r\nThe design proved to be too expensive to deploy en masse, and the smaller [[Nautilus Class Subspace Prowler]] was developed to take full advantage of the unique features of the ''Jerome Black''.\r\n\r\n== Development ==\r\n\r\nAt the end of the [[Second Exodus War]], the [[Federated Districts of the Prefecture]] began developing factories and depots on [[Estelis]] and [[Albanus]].  [[Rahn Industries]]' enormous financial resources were put to use with dozens of projects and military contracts at once.\r\n\r\nAmong their many contracts was the personal flagship for the [[Prefect]], dubbed the \"''Jerome Black''\".  It was originally conceived as a massively heavy weapons platform, designed to hit hard and fast, then escape combat.\r\n\r\n[[Image:Jerome Black Class Battleship Side View.jpg|200px]]\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, the incredible power requirements for the ship's eight Relativistic Mass Drivers meant that it was not a particularly fast design.  Instead, the first prototype [[Entropy Drive]] was deployed on the ''Jerome Black'' for combat testing.  The use of [[Subspace]] technology would allow the ship to acquire a target, slip in close undetected, enter normal space, attack, and disappear back into the murky depths of subspace.\r\n\r\n== Combat History ==\r\n\r\nThe only ship in the class was the lead ship, the [[FDS Jerome Black|FDS ''Jerome Black'']].  The Curiate and Senate determined that the cost of the ship was far too high to deploy numerous ships of the same type, and chose the smaller Nautilus Class--available for a third of the cost--for deployment in greater numbers.\r\n\r\n[[Image:Jerome Black Class Battleship Top View.jpg|200px]]\r\n\r\nThe FDS ''Jerome Black'' saw action in the [[Tempest War]], but was lost in subspace after a failed attack on [[Mesar]].  With the help of the [[Ixoarchada]], it was recovered after the war and refurbished. It became the flagship of [[Hannah Baruk]] after she became the [[Prefect]] when [[Anthony Hadrian]] was removed from office and disappeared.\r\n\r\n== See Also ==\r\n\r\n==== Comparable Ships ====\r\n\r\n* [[Iron Hand Class Battleship]]\r\n\r\n==== Complete List of Ships ====\r\n\r\nShips in the Class:\r\n* [[FDS Jerome Black|FDS ''Jerome Black'' (BG-1)]]\r\n\r\n[[Category:Battleships]]"
