        'rawContent': "{{Starship Class Information|\r\n|name =Arnoste Class Heavy Frigate\r\n|image = [[Image:Arnoste Class Heavy Frigate Standard View.jpg|200px]]\r\n|caption =A profile of the Arnoste Class Heavy Frigate\r\n|designation =[[:Category:Frigates|Heavy Frigate]]\r\n|builder =Various [[Iridi]]\r\n|operator =[[Ixoarchada]] [[NagáDeviri]]<br/>\r\n|number_of_ships = ??\r\n|list_of_ships = Notable:<br/>??\r\n|crew =380 Ship Crew<br/>\r\n|length =458.1\r\n|beam =85.0\r\n|height =114.7\r\n|total_volume =1,861,095.6\r\n|powerplant =1 x ??<br/>\r\n|propulsion =2 x ??\r\n|ftl_drive =1 x (???)\r\n|acceleration =??\r\n|sensors =\r\n|processing_system =1x [[Strolza Entity]]\r\n|aircraft =None<br/>\r\n|personnel =Upto 900 [[RhováDeviri]]<br/>\r\n|support_capacity =279,164.3\r\n|weapons =4 x [[Krinim Cannon|Krinim Cannons]]<br/>16 x [[Jiorna Node|Jiorna Nodes]]<br/>36 x [[Ixoarchada Ordnance Cell|Ixoarchada Ordnance Cells]]<br/>12 x [[Jiorna Node|Point-Defense Jiorna Nodes]]<br/>\r\n|armor =[[Falkran Armor]]\r\n|shields =[[Mulrigh Embedded Shielding]]<br/>[[Mulrigh Screens]]\r\n|special =??\r\n}}\r\n\r\nThe [[Arnoste Class Destroyer]] is an Ixoarchada ship.  Someone should sure write about it!\r\n\r\n=== History ===\r\n\r\nIt's got some.  See the old writeup.\r\n\r\n==== Development ====\r\n\r\nIt'd be cool if Justin could make some cool renders, too!\r\n\r\n[[Image:Arnoste Class Heavy Frigate Side View.jpg|left|400px]]\r\n\r\n[[Image:Arnoste Class Heavy Frigate Top View.jpg|left|400px]]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n=== See Also ===\r\n\r\nComparable Ships:\r\n* None yet.\r\n\r\nAdditional Information:\r\n* [[Arnoste Class Heavy Frigate.ldr|Blueprints download]]\r\n\r\n==== Complete List of Ships ====\r\n\r\nShips in the ''Arnoste'' Class\r\n* None yet.\r\n\r\n\r\n[[Category:Frigates]]"
