        'rawContent': "{{Starship Class Information|\r\n|name =Banshee Class Carrier\r\n|image = [[Image:MF Banshee.png|200px]]\r\n|caption =The Banshee Class Carrier\r\n|designation =[[:Category:Carriers|Carrier]]\r\n|builder =[[Northern Star]]<br/>[[Centusi Cargo]]\r\n|operator =[[United Centusi States Kriegsmarine]]<br/>[[Mesarthrim Federation Kriegsmarine]]\r\n|number_of_ships = 35\r\n|list_of_ships = 0\r\n|crew =2,355 + 2,500 Support Crew\r\n|length =\r\n|beam =\r\n|height =\r\n|total_volume =\r\n|powerplant = \r\n|propulsion = \r\n|ftl_drive =\r\n|acceleration =\r\n|sensors =\r\n|processing_system =\r\n|aircraft =\r\n|personnel =\r\n|support_capacity =\r\n|weapons = \r\n|armor =\r\n|shields =\r\n|special =\r\n}}\r\n[[Category:Mesarbauer]]\r\n[[Category:Carriers]]\r\n[[Category:United Centusi States Kriegsmarine]]\r\n[[Category:Mesarthrim Federation Kriegsmarine]]'"
